Replace the body of `interactive_prompt` to:
- Remove the `getchar()` drain loop entirely (it destroys subsequent stdin lines).
- Remove the whitespace-skipping loop (leading whitespace must decline per spec).
- Check only `line[0]` for `y`/`Y`.

